WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
Although the body is dead, the sound will be remembered in the history of the Qing Dynasty

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,160
Thousands of years later, there will still be people who remember you

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:07,120
Remember the things you did

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,360
Isn't this a kind of immortality?

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:15,740
General, I asked you to accept the command.

6
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:18,640
General, Lao Zhou is here to see you.

7
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:22,120
Now that there is peace outside the officialdom, no one dares to go south.

8
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,040
The inheritance you maintained back then

9
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,560
The juniors held on

10
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:28,600
Do you remember that boy named Chen?

11
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:33,430
He has also become a non-general. It is a pity that he is more powerful than you.

12
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:36,430
Li Longcheng Chen Botu I miss you

13
00:00:36,430 --> 00:00:37,950
Thinking of those brothers back then

14
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:39,870
The injustice you suffered was me

15
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,670
You are the deputy general of Yanmen, Commander Zhou.

16
00:00:42,820 --> 00:00:49,580
You are so similar to this

17
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,980
Commander Zhou, if there is a chance

18
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:58,010
Are you willing to seek justice for two non-generals?

19
00:00:58,010 --> 00:01:09,210
You mean that old house?

20
00:01:09,650 --> 00:01:12,010
Someone did come here some time ago

21
00:01:12,010 --> 00:01:14,090
Someone said they saw a young man

22
00:01:14,090 --> 00:01:15,370
Riding a big white crane

23
00:01:15,370 --> 00:01:16,610
Flying down from the sky

24
00:01:16,610 --> 00:01:18,370
That boy is so handsome

25
00:01:18,370 --> 00:01:20,210
Like a young Chen Polong

26
00:01:20,210 --> 00:01:21,810
He stayed in the old house for a long time

27
00:01:21,810 --> 00:01:23,210
I went to the grave again and burned paper.

28
00:01:23,210 --> 00:01:25,650
Then he flew away on a white crane. Everyone said

29
00:01:25,650 --> 00:01:27,370
That was General Chen who became an immortal after his death.

30
00:01:27,370 --> 00:01:28,610
Come back and see your hometown

31
00:01:28,610 --> 00:01:30,770
The boy riding the crane looks a bit like me

32
00:01:30,770 --> 00:01:33,210
My mother in my previous life, Lin Zhongqian, has been talking about her

33
00:01:33,210 --> 00:01:35,010
Dreamed that the crane picked up Huai Shuang

34
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:37,400
Everyone thought he was stimulated

35
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:40,680
Huai Shuang is really not dead

36
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:42,590
Parting from the past life

37
00:01:42,590 --> 00:01:46,170
Maybe it’s meeting Ye Xuan in the next life

38
00:01:46,170 --> 00:01:47,450
you are finally back
